WEBVTT

00:16.830 --> 00:19.920
<b>Oh Stale, are you back already?</b>

00:22.960 --> 00:27.540
<b>You've killed your mother, just as I ordered you to, right?</b>

00:28.130 --> 00:29.380
<b>Well done!</b>

00:35.330 --> 00:36.330
<b>You fool!</b>

00:36.750 --> 00:40.210
<b>You can't possibly kill the master
you signed the fealty contract to!</b>

00:41.460 --> 00:43.130
<b>Why did you make me do such a thing?!</b>

00:43.830 --> 00:46.920
<b>What did I... What did my mother ever do to you?!</b>

00:47.170 --> 00:47.960
<b>Not a thing.</b>

00:49.290 --> 00:51.670
<b>I just thought it'd be fun, obviously.</b>

00:53.130 --> 00:58.210
<b>Thanks to you, Stale, I'm having a whole lot of fun!</b>

00:59.000 --> 01:04.420
<b>Kill me! If it's so fun causing me
to suffer like this, then kill me!</b>

01:04.420 --> 01:06.080
<b>Okay, here's an order.</b>

01:07.170 --> 01:11.500
<b>From here forward, you are
not allowed to take your own life.</b>

01:19.960 --> 01:21.290
<b>I love that expression on your face!</b>

01:25.790 --> 01:27.170
<b>You'll pay for this...</b>

01:28.540 --> 01:29.790
<b>That woman...</b>

01:30.420 --> 01:33.460
<b>That devil wearing human skin...</b>

01:34.210 --> 01:39.380
<b>Someday I will avenge my mother.
And for that reason alone, I will...</b>

01:48.500 --> 01:51.130
<b>I feel like I had a dream...</b>

01:51.960 --> 01:54.670
<b>But I can't remember it.</b>

03:27.380 --> 03:30.330
<b>"The Villainous Princess Makes a Request of Her Brother"</b>

03:27.790 --> 03:31.500
<b>Let's see, today after this, I have a lecture on manners.</b>

03:31.710 --> 03:34.830
<b>I was also told I should begin
the basics of the sword soon.</b>

03:41.000 --> 03:42.750
<b>This is Pride's...</b>

03:51.250 --> 03:54.290
<b>At that time, I remembered my mom.</b>

04:04.080 --> 04:07.960
<b>I don't need money. Please don't take my Stale...</b>

04:15.210 --> 04:19.830
<b>I withstood everything.
Not for myself, but for someone else...</b>

04:19.830 --> 04:21.580
<b>I held on, and on...</b>

04:22.000 --> 04:24.670
<b>For the expression on their face when they were full.</b>

04:24.920 --> 04:26.000
<b>For who?</b>

04:26.460 --> 04:27.290
<b>For myself?</b>

04:29.130 --> 04:31.290
<b>No, that can't be right.</b>

04:32.040 --> 04:36.830
<b>I had heard she was just a stupid,
silly, incredibly spoiled princess.</b>

04:37.670 --> 04:42.670
<b>That's why I chose to feign obedience
and make use of Pride.</b>

04:43.880 --> 04:46.080
<b>There was no doubt that Pride would become queen.</b>

04:46.920 --> 04:52.420
<b>In order for me to become the ideal assistant
and an exemplary regent, I did everything I could,</b>

04:52.830 --> 04:56.170
<b>and if I came into her favor, then surely I'd be
allowed to change the country's rules in the future.</b>

04:56.670 --> 04:59.460
<b>The future will be one in which
I can freely see my mother.</b>

05:00.630 --> 05:03.630
<b>Everything is so I can one day see my mother again.</b>

05:05.130 --> 05:06.130
<b>And yet...</b>

05:16.500 --> 05:19.330
<b>If I do become the most deplorable queen,</b>

05:20.830 --> 05:22.630
<b>kill me, okay?</b>

05:24.130 --> 05:25.130
<b>That person...</b>

05:25.960 --> 05:27.960
<b>What is she so afraid of?</b>

05:33.080 --> 05:34.130
<b>Stale!</b>

05:34.960 --> 05:35.880
<b>Pride?!</b>

05:38.250 --> 05:41.500
<b>You're done with your afternoon
studies, right? Come with me.</b>

05:41.670 --> 05:43.130
<b>There's something I want to give you.</b>

05:46.170 --> 05:51.080
<b>This is an exception, so make sure this is kept in
absolute secrecy, even inside the palace walls.</b>

05:54.960 --> 05:56.040
<b>Open it.</b>

05:59.540 --> 06:00.580
<b>To Stale.</b>

06:01.920 --> 06:02.880
<b>Mom?</b>

06:06.130 --> 06:06.790
<b>Yes.</b>

06:13.000 --> 06:16.460
<b>Are you doing well? I am fine.</b>

06:17.330 --> 06:24.420
<b>The people of the city are treating me very well,
and I'm so happy I can write letters to you.</b>

06:28.000 --> 06:32.420
<b>From now on, I can live in anticipation of your letters.</b>

06:33.040 --> 06:38.040
<b>Please thank the Prince consort
for this service that he has given to us.</b>

06:38.790 --> 06:43.750
<b>Stale, please be well. Take good care of yourself.</b>

06:44.630 --> 06:45.790
<b>I love you.</b>

06:47.750 --> 06:49.420
<b>This was done at Pride's request.</b>

06:49.920 --> 06:54.290
<b>Normally, when the one who will become
the next regent is accepted into the palace,</b>

06:54.290 --> 06:59.460
<b>the incentive is only paid once, but we have
made it so a fixed amount is paid every month.</b>

07:00.000 --> 07:04.170
<b>At that time we will accept
only one letter from your mother.</b>

07:04.830 --> 07:08.080
<b>Once a year, you will be permitted
to write your own letter to her.</b>

07:19.540 --> 07:27.830
<b>Father, Mother, and I, and also your mother...
We all love you.</b>

07:33.040 --> 07:36.790
<b>I don't understand what this person is afraid of.</b>

07:38.080 --> 07:42.040
<b>This person who is so kind and
thinks so often of her country...</b>

07:42.710 --> 07:48.080
<b>I don't understand why she thinks
she'll become the most deplorable queen. But...</b>

07:49.210 --> 07:52.790
<b>You, and this country your mother is in,</b>

07:53.170 --> 07:55.630
<b>I will make it so that everyone can keep smiling!</b>

07:57.380 --> 08:00.420
<b>Pride kept her promise to me.</b>

08:01.040 --> 08:06.630
<b>That's why, if there's anything she's afraid of,
I will protect her.</b>

08:07.170 --> 08:10.040
<b>No, simply protecting her will not be enough.</b>

08:10.330 --> 08:14.170
<b>I want to make sure I repay her gratitude,
and this kindness.</b>

08:15.040 --> 08:16.710
<b>Even if it takes me my whole life.</b>

08:29.880 --> 08:32.290
<b>What should I write in my letter?</b>

08:32.460 --> 08:36.920
<b>It's such a troublesome thing,
that selfishness of Princess Pride.</b>

08:37.500 --> 08:46.210
<b>Due to the command of Princess Pride and the Prince
consort, I've no choice but to act in complete silence,</b>

08:46.210 --> 08:48.130
<b>but I have often asked for such special treatment.</b>

08:46.540 --> 08:49.290
<b>I can't hear him very well... who is that?</b>

08:55.130 --> 09:00.500
<b>If that is the case, do you still believe
that Princess Pride is too selfish?</b>

09:00.830 --> 09:02.830
<b>Yes, unfortunately.</b>

09:03.250 --> 09:08.040
<b>Well, assisting the members of the royal family
is our profession, after all.</b>

09:08.420 --> 09:09.670
<b>Gilbert?!</b>

09:09.670 --> 09:15.790
<b>In truth, and this is between us,
Master Stale may be feeling fairly ashamed.</b>

09:16.460 --> 09:20.830
<b>Commoner that he is, it's as if every day
Princess Pride looks down on him,</b>

09:20.830 --> 09:23.460
<b>and harasses Master Stale from the shadows.</b>

09:23.830 --> 09:25.630
<b>What is this monstrous lie he's telling?</b>

09:24.380 --> 09:26.670
<b>This causes concern for when she is made queen...</b>

09:27.040 --> 09:32.540
<b>Yes, it is good that the Prince consort and Her Highness
have both taken notice of this, but...</b>

09:32.920 --> 09:36.580
<b>Yes, for example, I have made
this request numerous times before.</b>

09:36.750 --> 09:40.080
<b>I would like to know about the Order of Obligation
to Apply for Special Abilities, and Princess Pride...</b>

09:37.380 --> 09:38.960
<b>He won't get away with this...</b>

09:43.750 --> 09:46.580
<b>I have to tell Father and Mother immediately...</b>

09:47.080 --> 09:48.670
<b>No, I can't.</b>

09:49.170 --> 09:52.380
<b>As I am now, they won't believe me no matter what I say.</b>

09:55.040 --> 10:01.080
<b>There's no point in only looking courageous.
I must be craftier, more scheming than anyone else!</b>

10:04.880 --> 10:07.290
<b>I have to comprehend people's hearts and minds,</b>

10:07.920 --> 10:13.290
<b>acquire people skills, and
win even more trust than Gilbert has...</b>

10:14.710 --> 10:19.750
<b>Pride and Father, Princess Tiara and Mother...
there's no meaning in only being liked by them.</b>

10:20.250 --> 10:23.670
<b>I must have an outer appearance
that will be liked by the entire nation.</b>

10:26.420 --> 10:33.750
<b>Father, Mother, and I, and also your mother...
We all love you.</b>

10:34.330 --> 10:37.040
<b>Since Pride has promised that as long as she's alive,</b>

10:37.040 --> 10:40.670
<b>she will make me, my mother,
and the people of the nation smile....</b>

10:41.540 --> 10:47.670
<b>I will spend my entire life protecting her
from the filthy adults.</b>

10:48.790 --> 10:51.750
<b>This isn't an intention. This is a vow.</b>

10:54.000 --> 10:58.330
<b>Starting right now, I am here for Pride Royal Ivy.</b>

10:59.670 --> 11:05.170
<b>No one but her will be queen. I will not allow it.</b>

11:10.380 --> 11:12.040
<b>The time has finally come.</b>

11:12.540 --> 11:18.670
<b>Pride and Stale are looking forward to meeting you
at your birthday celebration tomorrow.</b>

11:20.380 --> 11:22.920
<b>My, are you already feeling nervous?</b>

11:23.250 --> 11:24.710
<b>Yes, very.</b>

11:25.960 --> 11:31.040
<b>I wonder if my elder sister and brother will like me...</b>

11:43.380 --> 11:44.420
<b>Elder Sister.</b>

11:44.420 --> 11:46.750
<b>It's all right. I will be with you.</b>

11:47.710 --> 11:50.500
<b>Thank you, Stale. That's reassuring.</b>

11:51.790 --> 11:53.460
<b>Also, well...</b>

11:54.040 --> 11:56.670
<b>I neglected to say so earlier, but...</b>

12:00.000 --> 12:02.420
<b>You look pretty. Very pretty.</b>

12:04.130 --> 12:08.170
<b>Thanks. Stale, you look very dashing as well.</b>

12:11.380 --> 12:14.130
<b>While today is Princess Tiara's introduction,</b>

12:14.130 --> 12:18.920
<b>it's also the day that you are introduced
as the first in line for the throne, as first-born.</b>

12:19.380 --> 12:20.960
<b>Please hold your head high.</b>

12:24.750 --> 12:31.250
<b>Now announcing: First Princess, Her Royal Highness
Pride, and First Prince, His Royal Highness Stale!</b>

12:41.460 --> 12:45.880
<b>It's been so long, Pride. My darling daughter.</b>

12:46.330 --> 12:49.130
<b>Mother. I'm so happy to see you looking well.</b>

12:53.080 --> 12:55.540
<b>Mother, this is the first time
I have the pleasure of seeing you.</b>

12:55.540 --> 13:02.580
<b>I am Stale Royal Ivy. It is truly an honor
to be made a member of the royal family.</b>

13:03.380 --> 13:08.960
<b>As the next regent, I will make every effort
to assist First Princess Pride.</b>

13:11.000 --> 13:12.500
<b>Ooh, how admirable!</b>

13:14.540 --> 13:20.330
<b>Now announcing: Prince Consort Albert,
and Second Princess, Her Royal Highness Tiara.</b>

13:27.920 --> 13:33.460
<b>Tiara Royal Ivy. Protagonist of
the otome game "Our Ray of Light."</b>

13:34.420 --> 13:39.080
<b>The heinous crime that I, the most deplorable
last boss, will commit in ten years' time...</b>

13:39.830 --> 13:46.380
<b>The ones who would come together on that are Tiara,
and the love interests she healed on each route.</b>

13:47.540 --> 13:54.460
<b>That girl... My younger sister is the one and only light
for the love interests, and for this country.</b>

13:55.420 --> 13:56.500
<b>How fancy!</b>

13:56.500 --> 13:58.750
<b>Isn't she the spitting image of Her Highness the Queen?</b>

13:59.960 --> 14:02.580
<b>This is bad. I'm feeling a little gloomy...</b>

14:03.040 --> 14:08.170
<b>This is jealousy, I'm sure of it.
I mean, I wasn't spoken about like that.</b>

14:08.710 --> 14:13.290
<b>Tiara is cute, delicate, looks just like Mother...</b>

14:15.880 --> 14:16.920
<b>But even so!</b>

14:17.460 --> 14:21.500
<b>I will not torment her! I will not! Ever!</b>

14:23.170 --> 14:24.920
<b>Pride, Stale.</b>

14:25.210 --> 14:28.460
<b>This is your younger sister, Tiara.</b>

14:31.210 --> 14:38.420
<b>Tiara, I am Pride Royal Ivy. I look forward
to getting to know you, my dear little sister.</b>

14:46.330 --> 14:52.130
<b>I am Tiara Royal Ivy. I'm pleased to meet you, Big Sister.</b>

14:52.330 --> 14:55.330
<b>Gah! She's so cute!</b>

14:55.540 --> 14:59.000
<b>As expected of the protagonist who remains
likeable throughout the entire series!</b>

14:59.000 --> 15:01.290
<b>She wasn't rated a "True Angel" for nothing!</b>

15:03.630 --> 15:05.330
<b>I'm Stale Royal Ivy.</b>

15:06.130 --> 15:10.000
<b>Tiara, I consider it an honor
to have become your older brother.</b>

15:10.380 --> 15:12.880
<b>Huh? He's putting formalities aside already?</b>

15:10.670 --> 15:17.130
<b>Your elder sister, First Princess Pride, is a wonderful person,
just like Mother and Father.</b>

15:18.080 --> 15:24.130
<b>I believe that together we'll be able
to give our all to support our elder sister.</b>

15:24.630 --> 15:26.420
<b>Okay, Big Brother.</b>

15:32.380 --> 15:33.330
<b>I get it.</b>

15:33.790 --> 15:36.420
<b>Stale let the entire country know.</b>

15:37.210 --> 15:40.710
<b>He said that we have a relationship
that's more than family.</b>

15:41.080 --> 15:45.000
<b>He'll recognize me as the future queen and support me.</b>

15:48.170 --> 15:49.710
<b>Thank you, Stale.</b>

15:50.380 --> 15:51.250
<b>Tiara.</b>

15:52.000 --> 15:58.210
<b>We three siblings will go on
to protect this country, and its people.</b>

16:03.500 --> 16:05.130
<b>Long live Princess Pride!</b>

16:05.130 --> 16:06.880
<b>Her Royal Highness, First Princess Pride!</b>

16:13.170 --> 16:19.330
<b>This is our expectation for you.
This is a moment that you must never forget.</b>

16:23.290 --> 16:31.670
<b>A month ago, First Princess Pride's ability that
will make her queen, "precognition," blossomed!</b>

16:32.080 --> 16:36.250
<b>She will succeed me as queen of the next generation!</b>

16:37.580 --> 16:44.420
<b>Here and now, I once again recognize
Pride Royal Ivy as the next in line to the throne!</b>

16:53.960 --> 16:57.210
<b>That was splendid, First Princess Pride.</b>

16:57.750 --> 17:01.580
<b>You three stole everyone's hearts
with how well you carried yourselves.</b>

17:02.290 --> 17:03.670
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

17:04.130 --> 17:06.540
<b>Princess Tiara, you also had quite
the impressive appearance!</b>

17:06.540 --> 17:08.380
<b>I never would have guessed it was your first time.</b>

17:09.130 --> 17:10.460
<b>What a shame, though.</b>

17:10.670 --> 17:15.170
<b>Had you also gained "precognition,"
I'm sure you would be queen just like Princess Pride...</b>

17:15.170 --> 17:16.750
<b>I beg your pardon, but...</b>

17:17.290 --> 17:22.040
<b>What do you mean by "What a shame,"
Chancellor Gilbert, Your Lordship?</b>

17:22.540 --> 17:25.250
<b>Ah, how extraordinarily impertinent of me.</b>

17:26.420 --> 17:30.750
<b>You've changed in the short time
I haven't seen you, Prince Stale.</b>

17:31.380 --> 17:33.920
<b>Your expression has taken on
a royal family-like appearance.</b>

17:34.960 --> 17:39.460
<b>I do insist we have a thorough talk
at the next opportunity to do so.</b>

17:39.920 --> 17:45.960
<b>We shall talk of your birthplace and your former family,
and the special abilities of your acquaintances and such.</b>

17:46.380 --> 17:53.130
<b>Thank you. It is only with the support of the radiant
First Princess Pride that I was able to come this far.</b>

17:53.540 --> 17:58.630
<b>From here on, I want to do all I am able
to for her together with Tiara.</b>

17:59.130 --> 18:00.210
<b>That being the case...</b>

18:01.000 --> 18:05.420
<b>Once again, as the First Prince,
I look forward to making your acquaintance,</b>

18:05.790 --> 18:08.630
<b>Chancellor Gilbert, Your Lordship.</b>

18:12.920 --> 18:16.750
<b>What was that? That was very, intensely scary.</b>

18:17.170 --> 18:19.920
<b>By the way, First Princess Pride.</b>

18:21.420 --> 18:27.250
<b>As the first in line for the throne,
what do you think about the politics of this country?</b>

18:27.670 --> 18:31.170
<b>For example, about those that have
the same special ability as y-</b>

18:35.750 --> 18:36.790
<b>Stale...</b>

18:37.880 --> 18:43.080
<b>Unlike when you first came to the palace,
you've come to resemble Chancellor Gilbert.</b>

18:45.210 --> 18:47.750
<b>H-how so?</b>

18:47.750 --> 18:52.540
<b>Uh, let me see... Well, the way you laugh,
or something like that?</b>

18:54.040 --> 18:56.630
<b>My emotions don't really show on my face.</b>

18:56.630 --> 19:00.830
<b>I'm awful at that, or rather...
I've never been able to do that well...</b>

19:00.830 --> 19:04.830
<b>Oh, really? I'm sorry, I didn't notice until now.</b>

19:05.290 --> 19:07.630
<b>If it's hard for you, there's
no need to force yourself, okay?</b>

19:08.250 --> 19:12.500
<b>No, I do what I think is necessary for me.</b>

19:13.330 --> 19:14.170
<b>Tiara.</b>

19:14.460 --> 19:15.130
<b>Yes?</b>

19:19.920 --> 19:22.250
<b>Pride has changed quite a bit, hasn't she?</b>

19:22.960 --> 19:24.380
<b>Just as I told you, right?</b>

19:24.790 --> 19:28.170
<b>It's been since that day, when her ability was awakened.</b>

19:29.500 --> 19:36.000
<b>I have made numerous predictions of various results,
but that child of the future was unbearable.</b>

19:38.130 --> 19:42.080
<b>But even so, suddenly I can no longer see
a future for that child.</b>

19:42.500 --> 19:47.290
<b>It's as if the change is happening right now.</b>

19:48.960 --> 19:50.080
<b>Stale...</b>

19:51.130 --> 19:58.580
<b>Only a month has passed since he came to our palace,
but it's hard to believe he'd go so far for Pride's sake.</b>

20:00.500 --> 20:02.210
<b>First Princess Pride.</b>

20:03.420 --> 20:04.960
<b>Commander Rodrick.</b>

20:05.290 --> 20:08.130
<b>I was deeply moved by your words earlier.</b>

20:08.540 --> 20:11.380
<b>Congratulations on your right
of succession to the throne,</b>

20:11.380 --> 20:14.080
<b>and on Princess Tiara's birthday as well.</b>

20:14.670 --> 20:17.790
<b>Thank you, I'm very happy.</b>

20:19.170 --> 20:23.380
<b>The leader of the knights of this country,
who has been hailed as the "knight without a scratch."</b>

20:23.710 --> 20:29.710
<b>This appearance... I feel like I've seen it before
in this game. I can't quite remember, though.</b>

20:30.500 --> 20:33.460
<b>You truly have become a fine person.</b>

20:33.790 --> 20:38.170
<b>I hope that my son will also be able
to meet you some day, Princess Pride.</b>

20:38.880 --> 20:40.880
<b>Will your son become a knight?</b>

20:41.920 --> 20:44.540
<b>It would be fine with me if he did.</b>

20:47.420 --> 20:50.790
<b>I look forward to the introduction someday.</b>

20:51.960 --> 20:55.330
<b>The future has changed, somehow.</b>

20:56.540 --> 21:04.750
<b>Don't worry, Rosa. It's all right. Your beloved Pride
will surely become a great queen.</b>

22:47.920 --> 22:53.130
<b>Your elder sister First Princess Pride is
a wonderful person, just like Mother and Father.</b>

22:53.580 --> 22:58.290
<b>I believe that together we'll be able
to give our all to support our elder sister.</b>

22:58.880 --> 23:02.920
<b>I recognize Pride Royal Ivy as
the next in line to the throne!</b>

23:06.210 --> 23:08.040
<b>I hereby swear again.</b>

23:08.710 --> 23:16.710
<b>In 10 years, even if I am the worst of the worst,
even if I am hated by my beloved brother and sister,</b>

23:17.210 --> 23:19.380
<b>until the moment I am found guilty...</b>

23:21.920 --> 23:26.420
<b>I swear I will do everything within
my power for this country, and my people!</b>

23:29.580 --> 23:35.000
<b>The Most Heretical Last Boss Queen:
From Villainess to Savior.</b>

23:35.710 --> 23:39.460
<b>Episode 3: "The Heretical Princess and the Knights"</b>

23:37.630 --> 23:41.920
<b>"The Heretical Princess and the Knights"</b>
